MultiLanguageItemData['en'][202610] = {name = "[q4]Dragonfire Bomb Dispenser", additional_info = "Binds when picked up\nUnique-Equipped\nTrinket\n+473 Agility\n[q2]Use: Stick a Dragonfire Bomb to your target, dealing 38559 Fire damage after 7 sec. If your target dies with a bomb attached, it deals 32132 split between all enemies within 10 yards instead. Stores a maximum of 3 bombs. (30 Sec Cooldown)\n\n Critically striking 60 times triggers a flash of inspiration, allowing you to assemble an extra Bomb charge on the fly. (5 Sec Cooldown)\nSell Price:"}
