MultiLanguageItemData['en'][204465] = {name = "[q4]Voice of the Silent Star", additional_info = "Binds when picked up\nBack\n304 Armor\n+307 [Agility or Strength or Intellect]\n[q2]+ 317 Critical Strike\n[q2]+ 145 Haste\n[q2]Equip: Whenever nearby allies take damage, the Voice has a chance to beckon you. Upon hearing its call 10 times you fully submit to its influence, stealing 105 of the 4 nearest allies' lowest secondary stat, and giving you the stolen amount plus 1579 to your highest secondary stat for 8 sec.\nSell Price:"}
