MultiLanguageItemData['en'][204704] = {name = "[q4]Adaptive Dracothyst Armguards", additional_info = "Binds when picked up\n{Wrist} {Mail}\n277 Armor\n+144 [Agility or Intellect]\n+234 Stamina\n[q2]+ 134 Haste\n[q2]+ 134 Mastery\nDurability 55 / 55\n[q2]Equip: Occasionally you adapt to your current situation for 12 sec.\n\n Taking damage can grant you 170 Versatility and Critical Strike.\n\n Causing critical damage or healing can grant you 170 Mastery and Haste.\nSell Price:"}
