MultiLanguageItemData['en'][204706] = {name = "[q4]Spore Colony Shoulderguards", additional_info = "Binds when picked up\n{Shoulder} {Leather}\n258 Armor\n+193 [Agility or Intellect]\n+312 Stamina\n[q2]+ 179 Critical Strike\n[q2]+ 179 Haste\nDurability 100 / 100\n[q2]Equip: Dealing damage with spells and abilities has a chance to apply a stack of Ever-Decaying Spores to your target. At 5 stacks the spores rapidly decay and inflict ( 776 * 10) Nature damage over 10 sec.\n\n Sometimes the spores will immediately decay and inflict 776 Nature damage to you.\n\n This effect is increased by 100% if you equip an item crafted with a Toxified Armor Patch.\nSell Price:"}
