MultiLanguageItemData['en'][211982] = {name = "[q0]Warsculptor's Horned Spaulders", additional_info = "Binds when picked up\n{Shoulder} {Plate}\n4655 Armor\n+1,510 [Strength or Intellect]\n+6,712 Stamina\n[q2]+ 355 Critical Strike\n[q2]+ 695 Mastery\nDurability 100 / 100\nClasses: Warrior\n[q]Warsculptor's Masterwork (0/5)\n[q0]Warsculptor's Furred Plastron\nWarsculptor's Crushers\nWarsculptor's Barbute\nWarsculptor's Cuisses\nWarsculptor's Horned Spaulders\n[q0](2) Set Arms: Mortal Strike and Cleave increase the damage of your next Overpower by 10%.\n(2) Set Fury: Bloodthirst increases the damage of your next Rampage by 15%.\n(2) Set Protection: When your Shield Slam cooldown is reset by Strategist, you gain Expert Strategist, increasing the damage of Shield Slam by 5% and reducing all damage taken by 3% for 6 sec.\n(4) Set Arms: When Overpower has its cooldown reset by Tactician, your next Mortal Strike or Cleave has its damage increased by 10% and critical strike chance increased by 10%, stacking up to 2 times.\n(4) Set Fury: When Raging Blow resets its own cooldown, the damage of your next Bloodthirst is increased by 20%, stacking up to 2 times.\n(4) Set Protection: Shield Slam critical strikes increase the damage dealt by Thunder Clap and Revenge by 10% for 8 sec.\nSell Price:"}
