MultiLanguageItemData['en'][212054] = {name = "[q0]Maw of the Greatlynx", additional_info = "Binds when picked up\n{Shoulder} {Leather}\n2099 Armor\n+1,510 [Agility or Intellect]\n+6,712 Stamina\n[q2]+ 742 Haste\n[q2]+ 308 Mastery\nDurability 100 / 100\nClasses: Druid\n[q]Mane of the Greatlynx (0/5)\n[q0]Hide of the Greatlynx\nEviscerators of the Greatlynx\nMask of the Greatlynx\nLeggings of the Greatlynx\nMaw of the Greatlynx\n[q0](2) Set Balance: Starsurge damage increased by 10%. Starfall damage increased by 14%.\n(2) Set Feral: Tiger's Fury increases your chance to Critically Strike for 10 sec, starting at 6% and increasing by 1.0% every 2 sec.\n(2) Set Guardian: Thrash and Moonfire increase your damage done and reduce damage you take by 1% for 8 sec, stacking 3 times. (700ms cooldown)\n(2) Set Restoration: Regrowth, Wild Growth, and Swiftmend healing increased by 10%.\n(4) Set Balance: Lunar Eclipse and Solar Eclipse each increase the Astral Power Wrath generates by 2 and Starfire generates by 5.\n(4) Set Feral: Critical Strikes with your combo point-generating abilities increase the direct damage of your next Ferocious Bite and Rampant Ferocity or Primal Wrath by 15%, stacking up to 3 times. (700ms cooldown)\n(4) Set Guardian: Arcane damage you deal is increased by 5% and bleed damage you deal is increased by 8%.\n(4) Set Restoration: Your healing is increased by 8% when consuming Soul of the Forest's bonus and for 6 sec afterward.\nSell Price:"}
