MultiLanguageItemData['en'][217181] = {name = "[q4]Stormwing Harrier's Cuirass", additional_info = "Binds when picked up\n{Chest} {Mail}\n1928 Armor\n+862 [Agility or Intellect]\n+3,652 Stamina\n[q2]+ 734 Haste\n[q2]+ 294 Versatility\nDurability 165 / 165\nClasses: Hunter\n[q]Stormwing Harrier's Camouflage (0/5)\n[q0]Stormwing Harrier's Cuirass\nStormwing Harrier's Handguards\nStormwing Harrier's Skullmask\nStormwing Harrier's Greaves\nStormwing Harrier's Pinions\n[q0](2) Set Beast Mastery: Bestial Wrath summons a Dire Beast for 10 sec. (1s cooldown)\n(2) Set Marksmanship: Rapid Fire deals 20% additional damage. Trick Shots causes Rapid Fire to launch a Volley for 6 sec, dealing 100% of normal damage.\n(2) Set Survival: [ Mongoose Bite / Raptor Strike], Carve, and Butchery damage increased by 18%.\n(4) Set Beast Mastery: Your most recently summoned Dire Beast now obeys your Kill Command and can benefit from Beast Cleave.\n(4) Set Marksmanship: Every 10 Focus you spend has a 3.0% chance to reset the cooldown of Rapid Fire and cause your next Rapid Fire to shoot 100% additional shots during its channel.\n(4) Set Survival: [ Mongoose Bite / Raptor Strike], Carve, and Butchery have a 20% chance to make your next [ Mongoose Bite / Raptor Strike], Carve, or Butchery cost 20 less Focus and deal 80% increased damage.\nSell Price:"}
