MultiLanguageItemData['en'][229242] = {name = "[q0]Aureate Sentry's Roaring Will", additional_info = "Binds when picked up\n{Shoulder} {Plate}\n6132 Armor\n+2,452 [Strength or Intellect]\n+14,597 Stamina\n[q2]+ 932 Critical Strike\n[q2]+ 476 Haste\nDurability 100 / 100\nClasses: Paladin\n[q]Oath of the Aureate Sentry (0/5)\n[q0]Aureate Sentry's Encasement\nAureate Sentry's Gauntlets\nAureate Sentry's Pledge\nAureate Sentry's Legguards\nAureate Sentry's Roaring Will\n[q0](2) Set Holy: Your healing spells have a chance to apply Insurance! to their targets that heals them for (637.6% of Spell Power) over 15 sec. Insurance! is consumed if an ally drops below 40% health to heal them for (315% of Spell Power).\n(2) Set Protection: Each time you take damage you have a chance to activate Luck of the Draw! , causing you to cast Guardian of Ancient Kings for 4.0 sec. Your damage done is increased by 15% for 10 sec after Luck of the Draw! activates.\n(2) Set Retribution: Your spells and abilities have a chance to activate a Winning Streak! increasing the damage of your Templar's Verdict and Divine Storm by 2% stacking up to 10 times. Spending Holy Power on damaging abilities has a 12% chance to remove Winning Streak!\n(4) Set Holy: Divine Toll applies Insurance! to allies it heals for 8 sec. Divine Toll's cooldown is reduced by 1.0 sec each time you spend Holy Power. (500ms cooldown)\n(4) Set Protection: While you have Luck of the Draw! Shield of the Righteous refunds 1-3 Holy Power and extends the duration of Luck of the Draw! by 0.5 sec, up to 10 sec.\n(4) Set Retribution: When you lose your Winning Streak! you get the last Holy Power spent back, you cannot lose Holy Power for the next 4.0 sec, and the damage of your Holy Power abilities are increased by 10%.\nSell Price:"}
