MultiLanguageItemData['en'][229260] = {name = "[q0]Gale Sovereign's Zephyrs", additional_info = "Binds when picked up\n{Shoulder} {Mail}\n4076 Armor\n+2,452 [Agility or Intellect]\n+14,597 Stamina\n[q2]+ 950 Haste\n[q2]+ 458 Mastery\nDurability 100 / 100\nClasses: Shaman\n[q]Currents of the Gale Sovereign (0/5)\n[q0]Gale Sovereign's Clouded Hauberk\nGale Sovereign's Grasps\nGale Sovereign's Charged Hood\nGale Sovereign's Pantaloons\nGale Sovereign's Zephyrs\n[q0](2) Set Elemental: Your spells and abilities have a chance to hit a Jackpot! that summons a [ Storm Elemental : Storm / Fire] Elemental for 6.0 sec. Casting Ascendance always hits a Jackpot!\n(2) Set Enhancement: Your spells and abilities have a chance to activate a Winning Streak! increasing the damage of your Stormstrike, Lava Lash and Doom Winds by 5%, up to 25%. Maelstrom Weapon spenders have a 1.0% chance to remove Winning Streak! per Maelstrom Weapon spent.\n(2) Set Restoration: Your healing spells have a chance to apply Insurance! to their targets that heals them for (1248% of Spell Power) over 15 sec. Insurance! is consumed if an ally drops below 40% health to heal them for (650% of Spell Power).\n(4) Set Elemental: When you summon or extend your [ Storm Elemental : Storm / Fire] Elemental, your Lightning Bolt, Chain Lightning, [ Tempest : Tempest ]and Lava Burst deal 30% increased damage for 8 sec.\n(4) Set Enhancement: When you lose your Winning Streak! the winds shift into Doom Winds for 3 sec. When Doom Winds deal damage, your next Crash Lightning deals 12.0% increased damage, up to 60.0%. This effect can be stored up to 10 stacks. Additionally, Crash Lightning deals 75% more damage to your main target. (100ms cooldown)\n(4) Set Restoration: When you cast [ Surging Totem / Healing Rain], [ Surging Totem : 2 ] allies in the radius [ Surging Totem : have / has] Insurance! applied to them. When Insurance! is consumed, your next Chain Heal, Healing Surge, or Healing Wave is increased by [ Surging Totem : 10 / 10]%.\nSell Price:"}
