MultiLanguageItemData['en'][229269] = {name = "[q0]Tireless Collector's Hunted Heads", additional_info = "Binds when picked up\n{Shoulder} {Mail}\n4076 Armor\n+2,452 [Agility or Intellect]\n+14,597 Stamina\n[q2]+ 933 Haste\n[q2]+ 475 Versatility\nDurability 100 / 100\nClasses: Hunter\n[q]Tireless Collector's Bounties (0/5)\n[q0]Tireless Collector's Battlegear\nTireless Collector's Gauntlets\nTireless Collector's Chained Cowl\nTireless Collector's Armored Breeches\nTireless Collector's Hunted Heads\n[q0](2) Set Beast Mastery: Your spells and abilities have a chance to hit a Jackpot! that fires a Barbed Shot at 100% effectiveness. Casting Bestial Wrath always hits a Jackpot!\n(2) Set Marksmanship: Your spells and abilities have a chance to hit a Jackpot! that increases your auto shot damage by 200% and reduces the time between auto shots by 0.5 sec for 10 sec. Casting Trueshot always hits a Jackpot!\n(2) Set Survival: Your spells and abilities have a chance to activate a Winning Streak! increasing the damage of your Wildfire Bomb by 3% stacking up to 6 times.\n Wildfire Bomb has a 15% chance to end your Winning Streak! (Proc chance: 15%)\n(4) Set Beast Mastery: Hitting a Jackpot! infuses your pet with a mutagen, causing its auto-attacks to deal (12% of Attack Power) Nature damage to its target and up to 4 enemies within 10 yds for 8 sec. Mutagenic attacks reduce the cooldown of Bestial Wrath by 0.10 sec.\n(4) Set Marksmanship: Consuming Lock and Load also fires an Explosive Shot at 125% effectiveness.\n(4) Set Survival: When your Winning Streak! ends, your next [ Mongoose Bite / Raptor Strike] deals 400% increased damage and reduces the cooldown of Wildfire Bomb by 10 sec.\nSell Price:"}
