MultiLanguageItemData['en'][229323] = {name = "[q0]Spliced Fiendtrader's Loyal Servants", additional_info = "Binds when picked up\n{Shoulder} {Cloth}\n1610 Armor\n+2,452 Intellect\n+14,597 Stamina\n[q2]+ 478 Haste\n[q2]+ 930 Mastery\nDurability 100 / 100\nClasses: Warlock\n[q]Spliced Fiendtrader's Influence (0/5)\n[q0]Spliced Fiendtrader's Demonic Grasp\nSpliced Fiendtrader's Transcendence\nSpliced Fiendtrader's Skin Tights\nSpliced Fiendtrader's Surgical Gown\nSpliced Fiendtrader's Loyal Servants\n[q0](2) Set Affliction: Your spells and abilities have a chance to hit a Jackpot! that increases your haste by 12% for 12 sec. Casting Summon Darkglare always hits a Jackpot!\n(2) Set Demonology: Your spells and abilities have a chance to hit a Jackpot! that summons a Greater Dreadstalker at 180% effectiveness. Casting Summon Demonic Tyrant always hits a Jackpot!\n(2) Set Destruction: Your spells and abilities have a chance to hit a Jackpot! that fires a flurry of 6 Demonfire bolts at 100% effectiveness. Casting Summon Infernal always hits a Jackpot!\n(4) Set Affliction: Hitting a Jackpot! also increases the damage of Unstable Affliction by 50% and causes Unstable Affliction to spread to up to 3 targets within 40 yds for 12 sec.\n(4) Set Demonology: Casting Hand of Gul'dan causes your active Dreadstalkers to cast Dreadbite at 10% effectiveness. This damage is increased by 5% for each Soul Shard spent on Hand of Gul'dan.\n(4) Set Destruction: Hitting a Jackpot! increases your Mastery by ($mas)% and your spells gain maximum benefit from Mastery: Chaotic Energies for 10 sec.\nSell Price:"}
