MultiLanguageItemData['en'][229346] = {name = "[q4]Aspectral Emissary's Primal Robes", additional_info = "Binds when picked up\n{Chest} {Cloth}\n2342 Armor\n+3,269 Intellect\n+19,463 Stamina\n[q2]+ 1,270 Haste\n[q2]+ 607 Mastery\nDurability 165 / 165\nClasses: Mage\n[q]Jewels of the Aspectral Emissary (0/5)\n[q0]Aspectral Emissary's Primal Robes\nAspectral Emissary's Hardened Grasp\nAspectral Emissary's Crystalline Cowl\nAspectral Emissary's Trousers\nAspectral Emissary's Arcane Vents\n[q0](2) Set Arcane: Your spells and abilities have a small chance to hit a Jackpot! granting you Clearcasting and 5% increased spell damage for 12 sec. Casting Touch of the Magi has a 100% chance to hit a Jackpot!\n(2) Set Fire: Your spells and abilities have a chance to hit a Jackpot! reducing the cooldown of Combustion by 2 sec. Casting Combustion has a 100% chance to grant a Jackpot! at 100% increased effectiveness.\n(2) Set Frost: Your spells and abilities have a chance to hit a Jackpot! that fires a Frostbolt Volley dealing [(124.74% of Spell Power) * 5] damage to your primary target and (124.74% of Spell Power) damage to up to 8 additional targets. Casting Icy Veins always hits a Jackpot!\n(4) Set Arcane: When you hit a Jackpot! , you also gain 3 stacks towards Aether Attunement.\n(4) Set Fire: When you hit a Jackpot! your damage is increased by 8% for 7 sec. If you would gain Jackpot! from Combustion the duration is increased by 100%.\n(4) Set Frost: Icy Veins causes you to hit a Jackpot! at 100% effectiveness every 10 sec for 30 sec.\nSell Price:"}
MultiLanguageItemData['en'][229348] = {name = "[q4]Keys to Incognitro, the Indecipherable Felcycle", additional_info = "Binds when picked up\nUnique\nMount\n[q0](Account-wide)\n[q2]Use: Teaches you how to summon Incognitro, the Indecipherable Felcycle.\nRequires level 1 to 80 ( 80)\nRequires Apprentice Riding\n\n\n[q]\"This demonic machine was designed by Chief Engineer Ulzik as an experiment in cross-dimensional traversal. Despite many deaths during testing, Ulzik remained confident that this vehicle would reveal secrets of the universe previously unknowable.\"\nWorld Event:\nWoW's 20th Anniversary?"}
