MultiLanguageItemData['en'][232526] = {name = "[q4]Best-in-Slots", additional_info = "Binds when picked up\nUnique-Equipped\n{Two-Hand} {Mace}\n{7,750 - 9,965 Damage} {Speed 3.60}\n(2,460 damage per second)\n+3,269 [Agility or Strength]\n+19,463 Stamina\nDurability 120 / 120\n[q2]Equip: Your spells and abilities have a chance to grant you [ 3686 * (0.9)] to [ 3686 * (1.1)] of a random secondary stat for 15 sec.\n[q2]Use: Cheat to immediately gain [ 3686 * (1.1)] of your highest secondary stat for 15 sec. While out of combat, reconfigure for spell casting instead. (2 Min Cooldown)\nDefeat One-Armed Bandit in Liberation of Undermine on Mythic difficulty.\n[q]\"The wise goblin makes their own luck.\"\nSell Price:"}
