MultiLanguageItemData['en'][249340] = {name = "[q4]Wraps of Cosmic Madness", additional_info = "Binds when picked up\nUnique-Equipped\nTrinket\n+9 Intellect\n[q2]Use: Desperately unravel yourself over 2 sec to unleash a barrage of 10 cosmic missiles at your target, increased by your haste. Each deals ( 225 * 1 ) Cosmic damage split between nearby enemies. Damage increased by 30% per additional enemy, up to 150%.\n\n Allied deaths induce further madness, reducing the cooldown by 60 sec. (2 Min Cooldown)\n[q]\"Is it mad to sacrifice your world for victory?\"\nSell Price:"}
